IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- LEGISLATION ACT 2019, s 55: THE NEXT WORKING DAY.
--
-- "A thing that, under legislation, must or may be done on a particular day or
-- within a limited period of time may, if that day or the last day of that
-- period is not a working day, be done on the next working day." Working day
-- is the Legislation Act 2019, s 13 meaning (s 55 is in that Act); Matariki
-- Observance Days are the dates fixed in Schedule 1 of the Te Kāhui o
-- Matariki Public Holiday Act 2022 (2022 to 2052). Added 2026-10-17 at the
-- user's direction.

§ `Legislation Act 2019, s 55`

-- Te Kāhui o Matariki Public Holiday Act 2022, Schedule 1.
`the Matariki Observance Days in the 2022 Act` MEANS
    LIST Date 24 6 2022, Date 14 7 2023, Date 28 6 2024, Date 20 6 2025, Date 10 7 2026,
         Date 25 6 2027, Date 14 7 2028, Date 6 7 2029, Date 21 6 2030, Date 11 7 2031,
         Date 2 7 2032, Date 24 6 2033, Date 7 7 2034, Date 29 6 2035, Date 18 7 2036,
         Date 10 7 2037, Date 25 6 2038, Date 15 7 2039, Date 6 7 2040, Date 19 7 2041,
         Date 11 7 2042, Date 3 7 2043, Date 24 6 2044, Date 7 7 2045, Date 29 6 2046,
         Date 19 7 2047, Date 3 7 2048, Date 25 6 2049, Date 15 7 2050, Date 30 6 2051,
         Date 21 6 2052

-- Legislation Act 2019, s 13: "working day means a day of a week other than—
-- (a) a Saturday, a Sunday, Waitangi Day, Good Friday, Easter Monday, Anzac
-- Day, the Sovereign's birthday, Te Rā Aro ki a Matariki/Matariki Observance
-- Day, and Labour Day; and (b) a day in the period commencing with 25
-- December in a year and ending with 2 January in the following year; and
-- (c) if 1 January falls on a Friday, the following Monday; and (d) if 1
-- January falls on a Saturday or a Sunday, the following Monday and Tuesday;
-- and (e) if Waitangi Day or Anzac Day falls on a Saturday or a Sunday, the
-- following Monday". The Sovereign's birthday is the first Monday in June and
-- Labour Day the fourth Monday in October (Holidays Act 2003, s 44(1)).
-- After 2052 no Matariki date is fixed, so the answer is refused.
@ref Legislation Act 2019 s 13 working day
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is a Legislation Act working day` d MEANS
    IF   y GREATER THAN 2052
    THEN `no Matariki Observance Day is fixed after 2052`
    ELSE     NOT w EQUALS Saturday
         AND NOT w EQUALS Sunday
         AND NOT mondayised (Date 6 2 y)
         AND NOT mondayised (Date 25 4 y)
         AND NOT Day d EQUALS Day easter MINUS 2
         AND NOT Day d EQUALS Day easter PLUS 1
         AND NOT Day d EQUALS Day (firstMonday 6)
         AND NOT Day d EQUALS Day (firstMonday 10) PLUS 21
         AND NOT elem d `the Matariki Observance Days in the 2022 Act`
         AND NOT (DATE_MONTH d EQUALS 12 AND DATE_DAY d AT LEAST 25)
         AND NOT (DATE_MONTH d EQUALS 1 AND DATE_DAY d AT MOST 2)
         AND NOT (newYear EQUALS Friday AND d EQUALS Date 4 1 y)
         AND NOT (newYear EQUALS Saturday AND (d EQUALS Date 3 1 y OR d EQUALS Date 4 1 y))
         AND NOT (newYear EQUALS Sunday AND d EQUALS Date 3 1 y)
    WHERE
        w MEANS `Weekday of` d
        y MEANS DATE_YEAR d
        newYear MEANS `Weekday of` (Date 1 1 y)
        GIVEN month IS A NUMBER
        GIVETH A DATE
        firstMonday month MEANS Date (1 PLUS ((8 MINUS `Weekday of` (Date 1 month y)) MODULO 7)) month y
        GIVEN holiday IS A DATE
        GIVETH A BOOLEAN
        mondayised holiday MEANS
               d EQUALS holiday
            OR (`Weekday of` holiday EQUALS Saturday AND Day d EQUALS Day holiday PLUS 2)
            OR (`Weekday of` holiday EQUALS Sunday AND Day d EQUALS Day holiday PLUS 1)
        ga MEANS y MODULO 19
        gb MEANS FLOOR (y DIVIDED BY 100)
        gc MEANS y MODULO 100
        gd MEANS FLOOR (gb DIVIDED BY 4)
        ge MEANS gb MODULO 4
        gf MEANS FLOOR ((gb PLUS 8) DIVIDED BY 25)
        gg MEANS FLOOR ((gb MINUS gf PLUS 1) DIVIDED BY 3)
        gh MEANS ((19 TIMES ga) PLUS gb MINUS gd MINUS gg PLUS 15) MODULO 30
        gi MEANS FLOOR (gc DIVIDED BY 4)
        gk MEANS gc MODULO 4
        gl MEANS (32 PLUS (2 TIMES ge) PLUS (2 TIMES gi) MINUS gh MINUS gk) MODULO 7
        gm MEANS FLOOR ((ga PLUS (11 TIMES gh) PLUS (22 TIMES gl)) DIVIDED BY 451)
        easter MEANS Date (((gh PLUS gl MINUS (7 TIMES gm) PLUS 114) MODULO 31) PLUS 1) (FLOOR ((gh PLUS gl MINUS (7 TIMES gm) PLUS 114) DIVIDED BY 31)) y

`no Matariki Observance Day is fixed after 2052` MEANS
    REFUSE "Schedule 1 of the Te Kāhui o Matariki Public Holiday Act 2022 fixes Matariki Observance Days only to 2052"

-- Legislation Act 2019, s 55: the last day for doing a thing, moved to the
-- next working day if it is not one.
@ref Legislation Act 2019 s 55
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`the last day under s 55 for a deadline of` d MEANS
    IF   `is a Legislation Act working day` d
    THEN d
    ELSE `the last day under s 55 for a deadline of` (Date (Day d PLUS 1))

GIVEN d IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`the last day under s 55, if any, for a deadline of` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN JUST x THEN JUST (`the last day under s 55 for a deadline of` x)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
